# Moddy Arena: the prep room's hand-over. "A thing you hold is a real item; a thing that happens or appears is a wish on
# your hotbar." A make finished in the prep room does not appear beside him: it shows for a moment on the hand-over spot
# (the gold block in the floor by the east wall), then flies to him with the game's own pick-up motion and sound, and
# one action-bar line names it and the slot. A Builder creature goes on his hotbar as a wish and is not in the room; a
# Builder sword is a real sword; an Apprentice creature and an Apprentice sword likewise. The first time, a longer chat
# line says the difference between a wish and an item. With the hotbar full a wish goes to his Wish Bag and the line
# says so. A make started standing in the arena still lands in the arena. Nothing is charged when a make is
# kept (his Magician wishes are untouched, Builder and Apprentice wishes are free), and in a battle a fire of the kept
# creature costs one of the wave's hotbar wishes. No model anywhere: the Builder's pages and the Apprentice's local
# matcher make everything, and the hotbar replays the kept make's recipe.
# A resistance effect keeps him on his feet; the monsters are not what this tests, so they are removed by command.
# play-timeout: 1500
@intent a make finished in the prep room is handed over on the hand-over spot: a creature as a hotbar wish (none in the room), a sword as the real sword, Builder and Apprentice alike, with one line naming it and the slot, a longer first-time line, the Wish Bag when the hotbar is full; a make started standing in the arena still lands there; keeping charges nothing and a fire in a battle costs one of the wave's wishes
@world flat seed=1
@continue-on-fail

@step arrive
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@expect chat comes to you on the gold spot within 10s
@wait 2s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 1500 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 1500 0 true
scoreboard objectives add arenatest dummy

@step the hand-over spot is in the prep room's floor
# the middle of the prep room's east side (x 4, z 21), one block of its floor, gold
@assert execute if block 4 63 21 minecraft:gold_block
@assert execute if block 3 63 21 minecraft:oak_planks
# he stands in the middle of the prep room: what he makes now is finished in the prep room (where he stands decides,
# not where he looks), and he looks down at the spot to see it
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 -90 35
@wait 1s
@shot the-hand-over-spot

@step nothing is charged in prep: his Magician wishes are untouched
moddy wishes
@expect chat Magician wishes left before the next battle: 3 of 3 within 5s
@expect chat Builder and Apprentice wishes are free within 5s

@step a Builder creature made in prep comes to his hotbar, and is not in the room
# the Builder's first body (a cat), no parts, powers or moves (the core's own validation walks the same pages)
moddy builder
@expect screen Wish Builder within 10s
# the first page's tiles are worked out in the background (🔒 "Getting this page ready…" until then)
@wait 3s
@click item "A creature"
@expect screen Pick a body within 5s
# a page is drawn again once its tiles are judged; a click on the first drawing is lost (core)
@wait 10t
@click slot 0
@expect screen Parts within 5s
# a page is drawn again once its tiles are judged; a click on the first drawing is lost (core)
@wait 10t
@click slot 49
@expect screen Powers within 5s
# a page is drawn again once its tiles are judged; a click on the first drawing is lost (core)
@wait 10t
@click slot 31
@expect screen Special moves within 5s
# a page is drawn again once its tiles are judged; a click on the first drawing is lost (core)
@wait 10t
@click slot 22
@expect screen /tune your/ within 5s
# a page is drawn again once its tiles are judged; a click on the first drawing is lost (core)
@wait 10t
@click button "Make it!"
# the core puts the kept make on his hotbar and says so; the arena shows it on the spot for a moment first
@expect chat /is on your hotbar/ within 120s
@wait 3t
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:item,tag=moddyarena_handover]
# a burst of frames through the moment (it shows 1.5 seconds, then flies to him): the film of the hand-over
@shot film-01
@wait 3t
@shot film-02
@wait 3t
@shot film-03
@wait 3t
@shot film-04
@wait 3t
@shot film-05
@wait 3t
@shot film-06
@wait 3t
@shot film-07
@wait 3t
@shot film-08
@wait 3t
@shot film-09
@wait 3t
@shot film-10
@wait 3t
@shot film-11
@wait 3t
@shot film-12
@wait 3t
@shot film-13
@wait 3t
@shot film-14
@wait 3t
@expect actionbar /is ready! Slot 3\. Use it in the arena\./ within 5s
# the first time, a longer chat line says the difference between a wish and an item (said with the line above)
@expect chat /A thing you hold, like a sword, is a real item/ within 5s
@wait 5t
@shot creature-flew-to-him
# the hotbar wish is in slot 3 (the watch and the Wish Bag hold the first two)
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.2 minecraft:paper
# the copy on the spot is gone (it was only shown), and no creature stands anywhere
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:item,tag=moddyarena_handover]
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=wishmob]
# nothing was given twice: no other hotbar wish, no item lying about
@assert execute unless items entity @s hotbar.3 *
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:item]

@step the first-time line is in his chat
@key key.chat
@wait 10t
@shot first-time-line
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t

@step a Builder sword made in prep is a real sword in his inventory
moddy builder
@expect screen Wish Builder within 10s
# the first page's tiles are worked out in the background (🔒 "Getting this page ready…" until then)
@wait 3s
@click item "A magic item"
@expect screen What is it within 5s
# a page is drawn again once its tiles are judged; a click on the first drawing is lost (core)
@wait 10t
@click item "A sword"
@expect screen What does it do within 5s
# this world's Builder offers a sword one power, "Turn things into...": what it turns, then into what
@click item "Turn things into"
@expect screen Turn what within 5s
@wait 10t
@click slot 0
@wait 10t
@click item "Done"
@expect screen Into what within 5s
@wait 10t
# in this world it offers only Find: a search box, as the core's own Builder playtest uses it
@click item "Find"
@expect screen /find/ within 5s
@type "stone"
@click button "Find it!"
@expect screen /one of these/ within 15s
@wait 10t
@shot builder-into-what
@click slot 0
@expect screen /tune your/ within 10s
# a page is drawn again once its tiles are judged; a click on the first drawing is lost (core)
@wait 10t
@click button "Make it!"
@expect actionbar /is ready! It is in your inventory\./ within 120s
@wait 10t
@shot builder-sword
# a real sword, not a hotbar wish: the next free slot holds a sword
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.3 #minecraft:swords
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:item]

@step an Apprentice creature made in prep comes to his hotbar
moddy apprentice a cat
@expect screen Container within 10s
# a page is drawn again once its tiles are judged; a click on the first drawing is lost (core)
@wait 10t
@click slot 0
@expect actionbar /is ready! Slot 5\. Use it in the arena\./ within 120s
@wait 5t
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.4 minecraft:paper
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=wishmob]
@shot apprentice-cat

@step an Apprentice sword made in prep is the real sword
moddy apprentice a fire sword
@expect screen Container within 10s
# a page is drawn again once its tiles are judged; a click on the first drawing is lost (core)
@wait 10t
@click slot 0
@expect actionbar /is ready! It is in your inventory\./ within 120s
@wait 5t
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.5 #minecraft:swords
@shot apprentice-sword

@step a make started standing in the arena still lands in the arena
# where he stands decides: just inside the gate, in the arena, facing its floor
teleport @s 0.5 64 14.5 180 12
@wait 1s
moddy apprentice a cat
@expect screen Container within 10s
# a page is drawn again once its tiles are judged; a click on the first drawing is lost (core)
@wait 10t
@click slot 0
@expect chat /is ready/ within 120s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=wishmob,x=-15,y=60,z=-15,dx=30,dy=20,dz=30]
@assert execute unless items entity @s hotbar.6 *
@shot landed-in-the-arena
kill @e[tag=wishmob]

@step with the hotbar full, it goes to his Wish Bag and the line says so
execute unless items entity @s hotbar.2 * run item replace entity @s hotbar.2 with minecraft:dirt
execute unless items entity @s hotbar.3 * run item replace entity @s hotbar.3 with minecraft:dirt
execute unless items entity @s hotbar.4 * run item replace entity @s hotbar.4 with minecraft:dirt
execute unless items entity @s hotbar.5 * run item replace entity @s hotbar.5 with minecraft:dirt
execute unless items entity @s hotbar.6 * run item replace entity @s hotbar.6 with minecraft:dirt
execute unless items entity @s hotbar.7 * run item replace entity @s hotbar.7 with minecraft:dirt
execute unless items entity @s hotbar.8 * run item replace entity @s hotbar.8 with minecraft:dirt
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 -90 35
@wait 1s
moddy apprentice a cat
@expect screen Container within 10s
# a page is drawn again once its tiles are judged; a click on the first drawing is lost (core)
@wait 10t
@click slot 0
@expect actionbar /Your hotbar is full, so it is in your Wish Bag\./ within 120s
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=wishmob]
@shot hotbar-full

@step in a battle a fire of the kept creature costs one of the wave's hotbar wishes
teleport @s 2.5 64 18.5 180 0
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@wait 10t
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s
@expect bossbar Your wishes this wave: 5 of 5 within 5s
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@wait 1s
# the Builder creature's hotbar wish, in slot 3, fired at the arena's floor ahead of him
@key key.hotbar.3
@wait 5t
@aim look 180 25
@key key.use
@expect bossbar Your wishes this wave: 4 of 5 within 10s
@expect chat /is ready/ within 90s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=wishmob]
@shot fired-in-the-battle
